    tf: ["The final examination covers only the second half of the course.", false, "It covers both halves of the course."],
    sa: ["Explain how the covenants of the Bible lead to Christ.", ["covenant", "promise", "christ", "abraham", "david", "new"], "A good answer traces God's promises through Noah, Abraham, Moses and David to the new covenant that Christ established in his blood."],
